Template-Type:  SITEINFO
Host-Name:      www.oslonett.no
URI:            /
Description:    Oslonett AS is a Norwegian Internet provider with a full
                fledged set of Internet related services, inluding all
                types of Internet access, consulting services, firewall
                setup (reseller of Gauntlet) and electronical WWW based
                advertising. Dialup customers can use any WINSOCK
                compliant program (i.e. Mosaic, Eudora, ..) over dialup lines
                *without* TCP/IP, using Oslonett's own WINSOCK.DLL. SLIP
                and PPP accounts are also available though. Send mail to
		info@oslonett.no for further information.
Keywords:       Oslo, Norway, Norge, Internet, ISDN, Firewall, Dialup, Consulting, WWW

Template-Type:  DOCUMENT
Title:          Doctor Fun
URI:            /drfun/drfun.html
Description:    Norwegian cache for Dave Farley's daily Doctor Fun cartoon. 
		Only the frontpage and the latest drawing (with thumb) is 
		located here.
Keywords:	Fun, DrFun

Template-Type:  DOCUMENT
Title:          EFF's Extended Guide To The Internet
URI:            /html/eeggtti/eegtti.html
Description:    This is the latest version of EEGTTI served you through World 
		Wide Web. The HTML version as well as full PostScript versions
		are available. Note that this guide was formerly named 
		"Big Dummys Guide To The Internet". Due to copyright
	        restrictions, this name is now prohibited for use by EFF.
Keywords:	EEGTTI, Internet, Guide, EFF, Dummys

Template-Type:  SERVICE
Title:          Results from The 1994 Winter Olympics at Lillehammer (WWW)
URI:            /OL/OL94.html
Description:    Daily results from the events at Lillehammer are made
		dynamically available through Oslonett's WWW server. All
                data will be kept after the Olympics.
Keywords:	Olympics, Results, Sports, Lillehammer, Ski, Winter

Template-Type:  SERVICE
Title:          Results from The 1994 Winter Olympics at Lillehammer (WAIS)
URI:            /cgi-bin/OLwais.pl
Description:    WAIS index containing all files in the Web service
		at http://ol.oslonett.no/OL/OL94.html. If you prefer
	        to access the index directly through WAIS, the URL
		is wais://ol.oslonett.no:211/Olympics.
Keywords:	Olympics, Results, Sports, Lillehammer, Ski, Winter

Template-Type:  SERVICE
Title:          The Soccer WC'94 in USA
URI:            http://wc94.oslonett.no/wc94/index.html
Description:    Mirror server for SUN's WC'94 WWW server. The mirror
                server will be up and running even after the WC'94.
Keywords:       Sports, Soccer, WC'94

Template-Type:  SERVICE
Title:          Stock Listing from the Oslo Stock Exchange
URI:            http://www.oslonett.no/stocks/index.html
Description:    This is a free trial service where information from the
		Oslo Stock Exchange is made dynamically avalable through
		World Wide Web
Keywords:       Stocks, Quotes, Oslo

Template-Type:  DOCUMENT
Title:          The Oslonett Marketplace
URI:            /html/adv/ON-market.html
Description:    The Oslonett Marketplace is a commercial service (access is
		free!) where any potential information provider can use 
		the Internet and the World Wide Web framework as an efficient
                advertising medium without violating AUP policies and general
                guidelines for proper Internet use.
Keywords:	Advertising, Marketplace, Commercial, Mall, Shop, Shopping, Commerce, WWW

Template-Type:  DOCUMENT
Title:          Pointers to technical information on WWW related issues
URI:            /html/demo/WWWinfo.html
Description:    This document contains a lot of pointers to technical
		information of potential interest to any WWW developer
	        and HTML author as well as system administrators who
 	        want to set up "secure" HTTP servers inside firewalls etc.
Keywords:	WWW, HTML, Security, PGP, RIPEM, DES, RSA, URL, HTTP, Firewalls

Template-Type:  SERVICE
Title:          A Guided Tour in Oslo, the Capital of Norway
URI:            /oslo/oslotour.html
Description:    This little Web exhibit takes you through a guided
                tour in the famous Vigeland Park and parts of downtown
                Oslo.	
Keywords:	Travel, Norway, Tourism, Oslo

Template-Type:  SERVICE
Title:          Norwegian Travel Information Network
URI:            /NTIN/NTIN.html
Description:    This service is in beta, but the aim is to build up a
		virtual Web based network of information resources of
		potential interest to tourists and other people
		visiting Norway.
Keywords:	Travel, Norway, Tourism, Arctic, Svalbard, Spitzbergen

Template-Type:  SERVICE
Title:          Arctic Adventours, Inc.
URI:            /html/adv/AA/AA.html
Description:    Arctic Adventours is a Norwegian tour-operator selling
		exciting tours in arctic areas like Spitzbergen, Siberia
		and Northern-Norway.
Keywords:	Travel, Norway, Tourism, Arctic, Svalbard, Spitzbergen, Backpacking


Template-Type:  SERVICE
Title:          Norway's European Union Referendum
URI:            /EU/EU.html
Description:    This service will bring live results out to the Internet
                from Norway's EU referendum on November 28, 1994. Wire news
                messages covering EU will also be available.
Keywords:	Politics, Europe, EU, Norway, Election, Votation

Template-Type:  SERVICE
Title:          Atelier Nord
URI:            /home/atelier/index.html
Description:    Atelier Nord is a workshop for electronic art and graphics sited in
                Oslo, Norway. For the moment 27 artists work with different projects
                within multimedia, electronic images, animation, video, sound and
                graphic design.
Keywords:	Art, Gallery, Animation, Video, Sound, Multimedia

Template-Type:  SERVICE
Title:          Norwegian Broadcasting Corporation: The Rondo WWW Pages
URI:            /Rondo/Rondo.html
Description:    Rondo is one of Norway's most popular TV series for the moment (spring -95).
	        Oslonett and the Rondo staff has put up a Web service where they invite people from
	        all over the world to use the Internet to communicate with the staff. Free exclusive
                Rondo T-shirts will be drawn every week!
Keywords:	Television, Film, Culture, Norway

Template-Type:  SERVICE
Title:          Holmenkollen Skifestival
URI:            /Skif/HKS/HKS.html
Description:    Holmenkollen Skifestival is an annual sports event and part
                of the World Cup for Nordic Events. This WWW server provides 
                background material, statistics and live updates from the
                events, starting at February 15, 1995.

Keywords:	Sports, Ski, Oslo, Norway, Holmenkollen, Cross-Country, Ski-jump


Template-Type:  SERVICE
Title:          CandleWeb
URI:            /~candle/
Description:    CandleWeb provides a software architecture for efficiently
                implementing educational and commercial presentations 
                using real-time interactivity and fast graphics in 
                animations, fully integrated with the World Wide Web.
                The CandleWeb browser works with any standard HTML-browser 
                for X11.
Keywords:	X11, Web, Graphics, Animation, WWW, Education